WEBVTT

00:00:07.732 --> 00:00:10.692
[indistinct shouts]

00:00:33.976 --> 00:00:36.674
[grunting]

00:00:36.805 --> 00:00:39.285
Ooh!

00:00:43.899 --> 00:00:46.118
Ow! Ooh! Ow!

00:00:46.249 --> 00:00:48.773
- Let's begin.
- Wait, wait, wait.

00:00:48.904 --> 00:00:50.384
What?

00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:54.039
- Now?
- Yes, now.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.433
Unless the great
Oogway was wrong,

00:00:56.564 --> 00:00:58.740
and you are not
the Dragon Warrior.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.263
Oh, OK, well...

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:04.180
I don't know if I can
do all of those moves.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:07.139
Well, if we don't try,
we'll never know, will we?

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.100
Yeah, it's just, maybe
we can find something
more suited to my level.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:15.757
- And what level is that?
- Well, I'm not a master, but...

00:01:15.887 --> 00:01:18.412
...let's just start at zero.
Level zero.

00:01:18.542 --> 00:01:22.677
No. There is no such thing
as level zero.

00:01:22.807 --> 00:01:25.331
- Maybe I can start with that.
- That?

00:01:25.462 --> 00:01:27.377
We use that
for training children

00:01:27.508 --> 00:01:30.728
and propping the door
open when it's hot.

00:01:30.859 --> 00:01:32.121
But if you insist...

00:01:32.251 --> 00:01:35.037
[Po] Whoa. The Furious Five!

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:37.169
You're so much bigger
than your action figures.

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:41.304
Except for you, Mantis.
You're about the same.

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:45.351
Go ahead, panda.
Show us what you can do.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:50.356
Um, are they gonna watch,
or should I wait
till they get back to work?

00:01:50.487 --> 00:01:51.488
Hit it.

00:01:51.619 --> 00:01:53.882
OK, yeah. I mean, I just ate.

00:01:54.012 --> 00:01:55.971
Um... So I'm still digesting.

00:01:56.101 --> 00:01:59.931
So my kung fu might not
be as good as... later on.

00:02:00.062 --> 00:02:04.066
- Just hit it.
- All right.

00:02:04.196 --> 00:02:07.504
What you got? You got nothing,
'cause I got it right here.

00:02:07.635 --> 00:02:10.464
You picking on my friends?
Get ready to feel the thunder.

00:02:10.594 --> 00:02:12.988
I'm coming at you with
crazy feet. What you gonna do?

00:02:13.118 --> 00:02:16.078
Come on. I'm a blur.
You've never seen bear style.

00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:17.862
You've only seen praying mantis.

00:02:17.993 --> 00:02:20.474
Or monkey style.
[screeching]

00:02:20.604 --> 00:02:22.911
Or I could come at you
snickety-snake.

00:02:23.041 --> 00:02:27.611
- Would you hit it!
- All right. All right.

00:02:33.356 --> 00:02:36.664
Why don't you try again?
A little harder.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.536
How's that?

00:02:42.887 --> 00:02:45.324
Whoa!

00:02:45.455 --> 00:02:48.153
- [all gasp]
- [moaning]

00:02:50.199 --> 00:02:51.809
Ow! That hurts.

00:02:53.376 --> 00:02:55.334
[screams in slow-motion]

00:02:58.686 --> 00:03:00.862
This will be easier
than I thought.

00:03:00.992 --> 00:03:03.560
I'm feeling a little nauseous!

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:05.693
Ow! Those are hard!

00:03:06.911 --> 00:03:09.348
Oh! [moaning]

00:03:09.479 --> 00:03:11.133
My tenders.

00:03:11.263 --> 00:03:13.091
[groaning]

00:03:24.102 --> 00:03:26.235
Uh-oh. Ahhh!

00:03:31.936 --> 00:03:35.200
[groaning]

00:03:39.378 --> 00:03:41.032
How did I do?

00:03:41.163 --> 00:03:45.036
There is now
a level zero.

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:47.561
- [Mantis] There's no words.
- [Crane] No denying that.

00:03:47.691 --> 00:03:49.911
[Viper] What was
Master Oogway thinking?

00:03:50.041 --> 00:03:52.261
The poor guy's just gonna
get himself killed.

00:03:52.391 --> 00:03:54.872
He is so mighty!

00:03:55.003 --> 00:03:59.703
The Dragon Warrior fell out of
the sky on a ball of fire!

00:03:59.834 --> 00:04:03.533
When he walks,
the very ground shakes!

00:04:03.664 --> 00:04:05.361
One would think
Master Oogway

00:04:05.491 --> 00:04:07.929
would choose someone
who actually knew kung fu.

00:04:08.059 --> 00:04:10.018
Yeah, or could at least
touch his toes.

00:04:10.148 --> 00:04:12.629
- Or even see his toes.
- [laughter]

00:04:21.072 --> 00:04:23.074
[straining]

00:04:23.205 --> 00:04:25.207
- [thumping]
- Ow!

00:04:36.697 --> 00:04:40.962
- OK.
- [floor squeaking]

00:04:46.794 --> 00:04:48.622
Great.

00:04:53.322 --> 00:04:55.063
[wood breaking]

00:05:03.332 --> 00:05:06.465
- Hi. You're up.
- I am now.

00:05:06.596 --> 00:05:07.945
I was just... uh...

00:05:08.076 --> 00:05:10.034
Some day, huh?

00:05:10.165 --> 00:05:15.387
That kung fu stuff is hard work,
right? Are your biceps sore?

00:05:15.518 --> 00:05:20.915
I've had a long and rather
disappointing day, so, uh...

00:05:21.045 --> 00:05:24.222
Yeah, I should probably
get to sleep now.

00:05:24.353 --> 00:05:26.747
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. Of course.
- OK, thanks.

00:05:26.877 --> 00:05:29.750
It's just...
Man, I'm such a big fan!

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:32.535
You guys were amazing
at the Battle of Weeping River.

00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:35.973
Outnumbered a thousand to one,
but you didn't stop. You just...

00:05:36.104 --> 00:05:38.628
- [yelling]
- [wall ripping]

00:05:38.759 --> 00:05:41.196
Sorry about that.

00:05:41.326 --> 00:05:43.894
Look, you don't belong here.

00:05:45.504 --> 00:05:48.377
I know. I know. You're right.

00:05:48.507 --> 00:05:52.381
I don't have... I just...
My whole life I dreamed of...

00:05:52.511 --> 00:05:56.037
No, I meant you don't belong
here. I mean, in this room.

00:05:56.167 --> 00:05:57.647
This is my room.

00:05:58.822 --> 00:06:00.868
Property of Crane.

00:06:00.998 --> 00:06:02.826
Oh. OK. Right, right.

00:06:02.957 --> 00:06:05.350
[clears throat] So, yeah,
you want to get to sleep.

00:06:05.481 --> 00:06:07.309
- Yeah.
- I'm keeping you up.

00:06:07.439 --> 00:06:09.528
We got big things tomorrow.

00:06:09.659 --> 00:06:13.924
All right. You're awesome. Last
thing I'm gonna say. Bye-bye.

00:06:15.796 --> 00:06:17.536
Whoa.

00:06:17.667 --> 00:06:18.755
What was that?

00:06:18.886 --> 00:06:20.191
I didn't say anything.

00:06:20.322 --> 00:06:22.498
OK. All right. Good night.

00:06:22.628 --> 00:06:23.934
Sleep well.

00:06:26.545 --> 00:06:28.634
That seemed
a little bit awkward.

00:06:30.332 --> 00:06:32.900
Master Tigress!
I didn't mean to wake you.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:35.554
- You don't belong here.
- Yeah, of course.

00:06:35.685 --> 00:06:37.165
This is your room.

00:06:37.295 --> 00:06:40.429
I mean, you don't belong
in the Jade Palace.

00:06:40.559 --> 00:06:42.823
You're a disgrace to kung fu,
and if you have

00:06:42.953 --> 00:06:46.827
any respect for who we are
and what we do,

00:06:46.957 --> 00:06:49.133
you will be gone by morning.

00:06:54.573 --> 00:06:56.314
Big fan!

00:07:03.582 --> 00:07:07.499
I see you have found the Sacred
Peach Tree of Heavenly Wisdom.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.588
Oooh!

00:07:09.719 --> 00:07:11.677
Is that what this is?
I am so sorry.

00:07:11.808 --> 00:07:14.202
I thought it was just
a regular peach tree.

00:07:14.332 --> 00:07:19.468
I understand. You eat
when you are upset.

00:07:19.598 --> 00:07:23.689
Upset? I'm not upset.
What makes you think I'm upset?

00:07:24.821 --> 00:07:27.345
So why are you so upset?

